ian Animal Names — 100+ Beautiful Ideas 🐱\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"how-to-name-your-turtle\",{\"href\":\"/guide/how-to-name-your-turtle/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl\",\"children\":\"📖\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How to Name Your Turtle — Complete Guide 🐢\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"fantasy-dogs-names\",{\"href\":\"/guide/fantasy-dogs-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl\",\"children\":\"📖\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Fantasy Dogs Names — 100+ Ideas ✨\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"male-pets-names\",{\"href\":\"/guide/male-pets-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl\",\"children\":\"📖\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Male Pets Names — 100+ Ideas 💫\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"📝 Related Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"the-ultimate-guide-to-creative-purple-frog-names-120-ideas-for-every-purple-frog-owner\",{\"href\":\"/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-creative-purple-frog-names-120-ideas-for-every-purple-frog-owner/\",\"classN